title: The <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> implements their economic plan
new-page: true
is-card: true
max-visits: 1
view-if: (spd_wtb_plan or spd_left_plan) and unemployed >= 10 and spd_in_government and (economic_minister_party == "SPD" or finance_minister_party == "SPD")
tags: event
face-image: img/spd.jpg

= The <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> implements their economic plan

With control of the [? if economic_minister_party == "SPD": Economic Ministry?][? if economic_minister_party != "SPD" and finance_minister_party == "SPD": Finance Ministry ?], the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> has begun implementing their plan.

- @nationalization_implementation: The transformation of the economy begins.
- @wtp_implementation: Mass public works are started.

@nationalization_plan
view-if: spd_left_plan
on-arrival: spd_left_plan_implemented = 1; capital_strike_progress += 3; unemployed -= 3 if unemployed >= 6; budget -= 3; workers_spd += 8; unemployed_spd += 5; coalition_dissent += 1 if (in_spd_majority == 0 and in_left_front == 0); inflation += 3; socialism += 2; economic_growth += 2 if economic_growth < 5;

Industries are nationalized, most are compensated, but a few are illegally seized by workers. Nonetheless, this does reduce unemployement.

@wtp_plan
view-if: spd_wtb_plan
on-arrival: spd_wtb_plan_implemented = 1; budget -= 3; unemployed -= 4; workers_spd += 8; unemployed_spd += 8; inflation += 2; pro_republic += 3; economic_growth += 2.8

Money is once more flowing through the economy, unemployement has fallen sharply and inflation has noticeably ticked up.